        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing Contacts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在同步聯絡人"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統預設"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "測試 API 密鑰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "測試連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cloud tier is called only for ambiguous pairs — never for high-confidence matches or when you're offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有在配對難以判定時才會呼叫雲端 — 高信心配對或離線時都不會呼叫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The interface language changes after the app restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "介面語言會在 App 重新啟動後變更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主題"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These contacts appear to be the same person. Please confirm how to handle them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些聯絡人看起來是同一個人。請確認要如何處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These run instantly on-device with no network access required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些完全在裝置上即時執行,不需要網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These safeguards are recommended. Disabling them speeds up sync but increases the risk of data loss.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建議保留這些防護。關閉可加快同步,但會提高資料遺失的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This contact has no previous versions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此聯絡人沒有先前的版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will remove all saved duplicate resolution patterns. You'll be asked to confirm duplicates again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會移除所有已儲存的重複項處理模式,之後系統會再次請你確認重複項。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will restore all contacts to a previous state": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會將所有聯絡人還原到先前狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timeline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "時間軸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tint for buttons and highlights. System follows your macOS accent colour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按鈕與標示的色調。「系統」會跟隨你的 macOS 強調色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total Backups": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備份總數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total Contacts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聯絡人總數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total saved patterns": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已儲存的模式總數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trim the menu bar popover down to just what you use. Sync Now and Quit are always shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把選單列彈出視窗精簡到只留你會用到的項目。「立即同步」與「結束」一律顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use monochrome menu bar icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用單色選單列圖像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User Confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用者確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Values found:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到的值："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify access to Mac Contacts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證 Mac 聯絡人的取用權限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify connection to Google Contacts API": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證與 Google 聯絡人 API 的連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version History": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本記錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
